REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0020

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-28

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

Make the commands simple enough for anyone to use, and make the landing
demo commands copyable.

RAW_TEXT

Podemos poner los comandos mas sencillos para uso de cualquiera. Y que en
el demo se puedan copiar.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

PACE grew to ~17 commands, which overwhelms a non-technical user. Decision
(President): add an INTERACTIVE MENU - running `pace` with no arguments
opens a guided menu that maps to the existing commands. Technical commands
stay unchanged (no breakage with 0.4.0). Non-interactive (piped) still
prints help. Separately, the landing demo gets copyable command chips.

PROMOTED_TO

item 44 (pace interactive menu) + landing copyable demo commands

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
